      "field": "description",
      "before": "Elevate your festive wardrobe with this Cream Prabal Silk Indo Western Set, featuring elegant floral embroidery on premium silk fabric. Designed with a sophisticated Chinese collar and an open-style silhouette, this three-piece ensemble includes an embroidered Indo Western jacket, kurta, and pants. Perfect for weddings, receptions, engagements, and festive celebrations.\nKey Features\nPremium Cream Prabal Silk Fabric\nElegant Floral Embroidery\nClassic Chinese Collar\nOpen-Style Indo Western Jacket\nMedium-Length Silhouette\nMatching Cream Kurta & Pants\n3-Piece Indo Western Set\nIdeal for Weddings, Receptions & Festive Occasions\nStyling Tips\nPair with cream embroidered juttis for a timeless ethnic look.\nStyle with tan leather slip-on shoes for a refined reception ensemble.\nComplete the outfit with brown leather sandals for elegant festive celebrations.",
      "after": "Cream Prabal Silk Floral Embroidered Indo Western Set for Men. This 3-piece set includes: Indo-Western, Kurta, and Pant. Fabric: Prabal Silk. Composition percentages are not stated. Colour: Cream. Design: Chinese collar, open closure, embroidery (resham work). Fit type is not stated. Sizes 38–50 are chest sizes in inches: pick your chest measurement, as fitting ease is already included. Garment chest runs 41–53 in, shoulder 18–21 in. The model is listed as 6ft and wearing size 40 (merchant to confirm for this shoot). In stock at capture: 38, 40, 42, 44 (of 38, 40, 42, 44, 46, 48, 50). Care: dry clean only. Listed occasions: Wedding, Engagement, Reception, and Office Party Wear. Price: ₹ 53,438 MRP, inclusive of all taxes.",
